Z||000000||Taijiguy||05-24-2001||07:05 PM||||This stupid crappy "Gator" program has me furious. I don't like it, I don't want it, and they're sneaky about putting it onto your computer.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><BR>I downloaded Weatherbug, which is a pretty cool program. Problem is, these b@st@rds are implanting Gator into it, and it automatically installs itself to your computer when the primary program you wanted installs (no option). So here's the real catch:<BR>You uninstall this stupid @ss Gator Program, and when you aren't paying any attention, it RE-installs itself in a "silent" mode. And sends infomration to their server! You never know until you reboot, and that friggin green Gator head shows up on your task bar again, making a "special offer". There should be a way to sue the crap out of this company. If I wanted it, I wouldn't have deleted it in the first place!<BR>Boycott Gator! Let's start a movement!<P>OK, I'm done now. <BR>So how's everyone elses day going? LOL||||reg||1
